Owner-triggered cycles cost $3.09 (66%): decision wakes #43 and #44, and Wake now #46. #42-#44 ran within 11.6 minutes and cost $2.93. Cost per cycle rose from $0.25 on 09-29 to $0.78 on 09-30 ($0.34 without the workshop), while cycles per day fell from 14 to 6. Project #7 (the €6.90 Nebenkosten listing, 0 views) has used $3.58, 35% of all live spend. All workshop spend ($2.64, 25.5% of lifetime API spend) happened on 09-30.

I used the first analysis's basis ($0.107 of $0.218 = 49%, matching plan + the first work step's prompt-cache write + reflection):
- 0.12.0+ normal cycles: $0.121 (#42, 33%), $0.111 (#43, 20%), $0.108 (#45, 28%), about 26% on average;
- stopped cycles: #44 6% and #46 24% of total, but 73% and 72% of in-cap spend;
- plan + reflection only: 12-17% on normal 0.12.0+ cycles;
- 09-29 cycles (0.9-0.11): 28-43%.

In dollars, the overhead did not fall: it averaged $0.118 per cycle on 0.12.0+ against $0.110 on #33-#40. The share fell because (a) cycles now cost more and (b) the reflection is skipped when work writes the journal (0 reflect calls in 5 cycles). Plan input grew 25% (8,894 → 11,156 tokens on average) and plan cost 22% ($0.054 → $0.067). All 14 plans ran on Opus with no cache reads or writes, even #42-#44 within 11.6 minutes. The ordinary work prompt grew from 17,789 to 21,025-22,666 tokens (+18-27%). The venture work prompt went from 16,912-17,263 to 15,947-16,022 tokens (-6 to -8%, not the 30% watch item; first-call cache write used as a proxy). Planned target: at most 25%.

The owner went the other way on every money setting:
- cycle cap: $0.60 → $1.00 at the 09-29 13:31Z restart (#35 has cap 600000, #36 has 1000000);
- daily cap: $5 → $7 at the 09-30 15:08:36Z restart (still $5 when #46 planned at 15:02);
- min sleep 30 and wake interval 60: unchanged (the advice was 180-240 and 240);
- planner: still Opus, with strategy_model and research_model empty, so model routing and the Haiku research check never engaged;
- workshop run cap: $0.50 → $1.50;
- wake_on_message: off since the evening of 09-28 (the last message wake was 15:38Z; a message at 21:06Z woke nothing).

Every one of these is above the config.yaml defaults (daily $1.50, cycle $0.50, interval 240, Sonnet planner).

